<body>
    <h1>6c. Escalations to Other Teams</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"26234f88a204"></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b143eefc-6518-4ede-8ec5-e0ea2a71b57f">
<li local-id=3D"86ef5a3e-f95c-47f3-a3ac-82a1abb81309">
<p local-id=3D"64f1663d0204"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090383/6c.+Escalations+to+Other+Teams#Escalations-t=
o-the-Investigations-Team-(INV)" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Escalations to the Inv=
estigations Team (INV)</u></a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f7f88587-7e0c-490f-9f6e-ea7d16c43652">
<p local-id=3D"f1a8d171ec2b"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090383/6c.+Escalations+to+Other+Teams#Escalations-t=
o-Customer-Support-(CS)" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Escalations to Customer Suppor=
t (CS)</u></a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"abf11359-449f-4c14-8a3f-c2a4cbaed6a4">
<p local-id=3D"c747c53931dc"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090383/6c.+Escalations+to+Other+Teams#Escalations-t=
o-the-Community-Team" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Escalations to the Community Team=
</u></a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5b74812ffb09">
<p local-id=3D"b93ac0b33431"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090383/6c.+Escalations+to+Other+Teams#Escalations-t=
o-the-Places-team" rel=3D"nofollow">Escalations to the Places Team</a></p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"76a7a00f-d29a-49c5-a32c-c74e34df3c57">
<p local-id=3D"4ca17d1cd993"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090383/6c.+Escalations+to+Other+Teams#Escalations-t=
o-Partners-(Viator%2C-TheFork%2C-VR)" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Escalations to Pa=
rtners (Viator, TheFork, VR)</u></a></p></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"364ac5846d06" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-Escalatio=
nstotheInvestigationsTeam(INV)"><strong>Escalations to the Investigations T=
eam (INV)</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"6c2b1127ebde">The Investigations Team handles large-scale fr=
aud and high-sensitivity cases.</p>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #FFEBE6;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #FFEBE6;">
<p local-id=3D"f5c55d57ea4f"><strong>Do not overturn</strong> any removals =
made by INV. If you believe a removal was made in error, escalate to <stron=
g>FS Tier 2</strong>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"6372093174e3" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-Whoarethe=
investigators?:"><strong>Who are the investigators?:</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"a7bb71ef6e9c">Bobby O'Neill (roneill), Garrett Traylor (gtra=
ylor), Nopparat Ma (nma/Nopparat), Shawn Marquis (smarquis), Janka Krasznai=
 (jkrasznai), Lucille Pierre (lpierre), and Nicolette Torres (ntorres).</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"dae3ac086fc1" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-Mandatory=
INVEscalationTopics:"><strong>Mandatory INV Escalation Topics:</strong></h2=
>
<ul local-id=3D"e5f656a4-a3e1-4c5f-9226-f34a89a29b41">
<li local-id=3D"42f2a9ba-4193-42a4-a7a2-62e859059022">
<p local-id=3D"9540cb0d4304"><strong>Impersonation:</strong> Users pretendi=
ng to be someone else (e.g., celebrities).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"471ed0da-83a1-4d53-8e52-c157a48d74c5">
<p local-id=3D"08ff916d7e86"><strong>Red Badge Cases:</strong> Any conversa=
tion with a property currently under a Red Badge (active or inactive, withi=
n the previous year, like a penalty)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"09fb1096-292d-4764-aa07-c700f15cc8cc">
<p local-id=3D"72207794b849"><strong>Media/Lockdown Badges:</strong> Proper=
ties with a Media Badge or Lockdown. Look for BADGEHOLD or BADGEBUG notes i=
n the Location Center.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c672ecfb-a983-463c-bb64-4c3bbcf0ad9e">
<p local-id=3D"e30968ec176a"><strong>Review Gating:</strong> Systems design=
ed to only solicit reviews from happy customers.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3c514b20-423e-491c-ae17-25de99b2c26b">
<p local-id=3D"75e3c650be62"><strong>Restricted Reviews:</strong> Booking p=
olicies that forbid guests from writing reviews.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ad480d4-806d-4522-a2ab-337159d3a945">
<p local-id=3D"e9385182aff3"><strong>Branding Misuse:</strong> Users/Owners=
 misusing TCA badges or claiming false rankings (e.g., "No. 1 Tour").</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"69d6898c-7b7c-40d4-ae84-661a97a5e8eb">
<p local-id=3D"a577f1bcb7e8"><strong>Paid Review Patterns:</strong> Evidenc=
e of organized paid review schemes.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ff6003f-ab1b-4ab1-8162-013e041df262">
<p local-id=3D"fd64bd5418a8"><strong>Project Nomen:</strong> Follow the spe=
cific escalation process for these tickets.</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"fb5553898be1">Always expand "Location Notes" in the LC. If y=
ou see <strong>"FRAUD SUPPORT TO BE HANDLED BY INVESTIGATIONS,"</strong> as=
sign the ticket to INV Support immediately using the <em>Note Present</em> =
macro.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"9d2cb9ae1f57"><strong>Continuity:</strong> If an Investigato=
r handled a previous FPS conversation with a property, assign a new ticket =
about the same issue back to them to continue the conversation.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"1e7befe6b228" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-HowtoEsca=
late:"><strong>How to Escalate:</strong></h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"b473c1fa-fa89-4fa6-9fa9-1e734693bcc9">
<li local-id=3D"69cedce9-ba0e-4b57-aa47-43cb6ff05681">
<p local-id=3D"b2a52e57a942"><strong>Select Macro:</strong> Escalate/Transf=
er &gt; To Investigations</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a96df717-43c1-4595-ad5d-09e8f75c321a">
<p local-id=3D"e2783e7e7268"><strong>Summary:</strong> Briefly explain the =
issue.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"37282d2c-a61c-401c-915a-d4983ae30e74">
<p local-id=3D"5ff5148c01d7"><strong>Submit as open</strong></p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"a71bc14ea707">
<h1 local-id=3D"11c666ffa1d8" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-Escalatio=
nstoCustomerSupport(CS)"><strong>Escalations to Customer Support (CS)</stro=
ng></h1>
<p local-id=3D"5f4bcb295aeb">If a ticket contains <strong>no fraud or moder=
ation issues</strong>, transfer it to CS.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f4845b56c6a3"><strong>Common Scenarios:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e76f50ff-9f43-4012-821d-32407d32e8a2">
<li local-id=3D"de047030-bae1-4c28-82d4-2c811739d08a">
<p local-id=3D"b09d6388208e"><strong>User:</strong> Password resets, accoun=
t access.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"16b4aaac-a699-4c4c-8458-1bfa0d99ffca">
<p local-id=3D"c0c8e573885d"><strong>Owner:</strong> Listing updates (name/=
closure), questions on how to use our site, questions about bubbles rating.=
</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ece0f1149817"><strong>How to Escalate:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"fd994fea-398a-4efc-8add-f3f2e0c40563">
<li local-id=3D"6fca8981-0af6-4e56-9b11-00a13fb31c67">
<p local-id=3D"aacc1a47d9fa"><strong>Select Macro:</strong> Escalate/Transf=
er &gt; To Customer Support.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7da80eed-f9d2-405e-a137-ecc14667f274">
<p local-id=3D"940369ed5c7e"><strong>Clean the Ticket:</strong> Remove inte=
rnal Fraud Support jargon (e.g., do not use "Rev. RR" or "DC Policy").</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"74ab22bd-2882-4b73-b2fa-e40481520e50">
<p local-id=3D"ba0d801e3ea2"><strong>Summary:</strong> Briefly explain the =
user's need (e.g., "Owner wants to change property name").</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9d475158f880">
<p local-id=3D"70d7169436ed"><strong>Submit as solved</strong></p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"c36f16c6cd13"><strong>Follow-up:</strong> If the user compla=
ins after 3 days that CS hasn't responded, create a new ticket and send it =
to CS again.</p>
</div>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"39333a2e-947c-4532-ae2c-1b5e3f83737c">
<h1 local-id=3D"f313045b8e14" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-Escalatio=
nstotheCommunityTeam"><strong>Escalations to the Community Team</strong></h=
1>
<p local-id=3D"e74e882cfe3c">Transfer cases involving <strong>member-to-mem=
ber interactions</strong> and <strong>community standards</strong>.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ba3b4d0cdcb1">
<li local-id=3D"d6d955f7-547b-4f43-bdc1-4f8ac5def284">
<p local-id=3D"ec6cd9467528"><strong>User Bullying:</strong> Harassment bet=
ween two users.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"24221e77-7806-471a-9279-222556c72e8d">
<p local-id=3D"2841aa6441c6"><strong>Profile Photos:</strong> Photos involv=
ing illegal substances, escort services, or spam.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5e09511f-f16c-4c48-974d-6bc0651daab6">
<p local-id=3D"b4f577d3b692"><strong>Account Closure:</strong> Any user req=
uesting to delete their account.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bf66378c-a92d-4300-a1b6-685234fb1863">
<p local-id=3D"98a18926ece7"><strong>Community Posts:</strong> Issues with =
Forum or Q&amp;A content.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"8972e914d11c"><strong>How to Escalate:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"0f75d88692cf">
<li local-id=3D"19e5c7c9b925">
<p local-id=3D"f9b490a787e9"><strong>Select Macro:</strong> Escalate/Transf=
er &gt; To Community.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"63b791f96fc0">
<p local-id=3D"8f7bab1d13a8"><strong>Clean the Ticket:</strong> Remove inte=
rnal Fraud Support jargon (e.g., do not use "Rev. RR" or "DC Policy").</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"d01fd008122e">
<p local-id=3D"05fc80b6cd0d"><strong>Summary:</strong> Briefly explain the =
issue (e.g., "User is bullying another user").</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ce5e82b37d7f">
<p local-id=3D"1a62c4748039"><strong>Submit as solved</strong></p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"72e3a4ae-98a5-40fa-9490-787d823e7694">
<h1 local-id=3D"06d0be87cdce" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-Escalatio=
nstothePlacesteam"><strong>Escalations to the Places team</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"52bcac5203ed">Transfer cases involving listings problems tha=
t don=E2=80=99t need a reply reported by TA colleagues or users. If the req=
uest is from an owner and needs a reply please send it to CS instead.</p>
<p local-id=3D"702bfa15c1b6"><strong>How to Escalate:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1c5b7bee-6e91-43b3-9e72-d947c8a2b1e0">
<li local-id=3D"ec0310ea-fc9b-4363-a895-5e9a87fc4a57">
<p local-id=3D"458332626c4f"><strong>Select Macro:</strong> Escalate/Transf=
er &gt; To Places</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"643ff407-27d7-44b9-b6ac-14c3b8c5bb32">
<p local-id=3D"e300b8377049"><strong>Summary:</strong> Briefly explain the =
issue (e.g., "Listing should be closed because it=E2=80=99s a dupe").</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"86ab9aeb10fc">
<p local-id=3D"334808097441"><strong>Submit as solved</strong></p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"e5f8dc144abf">
<h1 local-id=3D"61d9b5784abf" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-Escalatio=
nstoPartners(Viator,TheFork,VR)"><strong>Escalations to Partners (Viator, T=
heFork, VR)</strong></h1>
<h3 local-id=3D"2412d775ec3f" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-Viator"><=
strong>Viator</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"8d903d55-b9ce-42c2-9e6f-4b6129092236">
<li local-id=3D"f096f62c-61bc-4e05-af7a-db207760e23d">
<p local-id=3D"c1022fc4acc9"><strong>Customers:</strong> Direct them to <a =
class=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:exp-cscare@viator.com" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">exp-cscare@viator.com</a> if the issue is not about reviews.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b2fda19a-6717-4342-af6d-e09247580a15">
<p local-id=3D"8d098d0de35f"><strong>Owners/Suppliers:</strong> Process to =
the best of your ability. If stuck, use macro FS Tier 2 - Viator Inquiry.</=
p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"97de5aca9579" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-TheFork">=
<strong>TheFork</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"c0d8f696-3d63-46f9-963d-ee4f7815f889">
<li local-id=3D"f393e743-07f4-47ab-95f3-a658a2d6cb6b">
<p local-id=3D"ad9b41fe4aa6"><strong>Review Disputes:</strong> Direct owner=
s to<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://manager.thefork.com/login" r=
el=3D"nofollow"> <u>TheFork Manager</u></a>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"522a590c4bf4" id=3D"id-6c.EscalationstoOtherTeams-VacationR=
entals(VR)"><strong>Vacation Rentals (VR)</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"cac19ced-67f6-49c1-8f7a-616729a904ea">
<li local-id=3D"d18c6bd3-2b17-4003-8457-dc8828301ad6">
<p local-id=3D"cbc79b22de5f"><strong>Non-Fraud Issues:</strong> We should n=
ot see any VR tickets anymore but if you do and they are not related to fra=
ud, please escalate to Tier 2.</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
------=_Part_2_700133690.1785924571341--
